
# Kenney input prompts: the full pack stays on disk, but only its licence and the icons the game
# uses are uploaded. These are the source files tools/prepare-input-icons.ts reads; if the game
# starts using a new icon, add it here (tests/test-input.ts checks this list).
ASSETS/UI - inputs/**
!ASSETS/UI - inputs/**/
!ASSETS/UI - inputs/License.txt
!ASSETS/UI - inputs/Keyboard & Mouse/Vector/keyboard_0_outline.svg
